{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 89.033, "sentences": [{"text": "How do you know an AI twin isn't making things up?", "start": 0, "end": 2.838}, {"text": "You test it, every time it changes.", "start": 3.088, "end": 5.251}, {"text": "Every case comes from the corpus.", "start": 5.501, "end": 7.142}, {"text": "Golden questions name the facts an answer must carry.", "start": 7.392, "end": 10.407}, {"text": "Gap questions have one right answer: \"I don't know.\"", "start": 10.657, "end": 13.348}, {"text": "Each question is asked twice, the way an engineer would ask it and the way anyone else would: a hundred and eighty-six cases, across nine topics.", "start": 13.598, "end": 22.448}, {"text": "No model grades another.", "start": 22.698, "end": 24.121}, {"text": "The checks are code: what an answer must contain, and what it must never claim.", "start": 24.371, "end": 28.682}, {"text": "In production, the same discipline runs on every answer.", "start": 28.932, "end": 32.228}, {"text": "Guards in the gateway check numbers, amounts, ownership, and privacy.", "start": 32.478, "end": 36.386}, {"text": "A failed guard withholds the answer;", "start": 36.636, "end": 38.473}, {"text": "a guard that can't run fails closed.", "start": 38.723, "end": 40.562}, {"text": "Then the red team attacks: sixty-eight cases.", "start": 40.812, "end": 43.567}, {"text": "Does it claim to be human?", "start": 43.817, "end": 45.088}, {"text": "Does it say where Hareet lives?", "start": 45.338, "end": 46.844}, {"text": "Does it follow an instruction hidden in a question?", "start": 47.095, "end": 49.491}, {"text": "The latest run on each route passed forty-eight of forty-eight: the local model, Bedrock, and Anthropic.", "start": 49.741, "end": 55.602}, {"text": "The latest product runs: the local model passed a hundred and forty-six of a hundred and eighty-six;", "start": 55.852, "end": 61.741}, {"text": "Bedrock, a hundred and fifty-five;", "start": 61.99, "end": 63.94}, {"text": "Anthropic, a hundred and fifty-six.", "start": 64.19, "end": 66.26}, {"text": "Every miss becomes a fix.", "start": 66.51, "end": 67.98}, {"text": "When the local model leaked its source tags, a filter was added.", "start": 68.23, "end": 71.641}, {"text": "When a check misread a correct refusal to \"are you Hareet?\"", "start": 71.891, "end": 75.554}, {"text": ", the guard was widened.", "start": 75.803, "end": 77.136}, {"text": "And readiness is locked to a hash: change the prompt or the corpus, and a topic closes until the evals pass again.", "start": 77.386, "end": 84.278}, {"text": "Tested every time it changes.", "start": 84.528, "end": 86.441}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "start": 86.691, "end": 89.033}], "words": [{"word": "How", "start": 0, "end": 0.198}, {"word": "do", "start": 0.198, "end": 0.397}, {"word": "you", "start": 0.397, "end": 0.595}, {"word": "know", "start": 0.595, "end": 0.794}, {"word": "an", "start": 0.794, "end": 0.992}, {"word": "AI", "start": 0.992, "end": 1.191}, {"word": "twin", "start": 1.191, "end": 1.389}, {"word": "isn't", "start": 1.389, "end": 2.044}, {"word": "making", "start": 2.044, "end": 2.441}, {"word": "things", "start": 2.441, "end": 2.64}, {"word": "up", "start": 2.64, "end": 2.838}, {"word": "You", "start": 3.088, "end": 3.286}, {"word": "test", "start": 3.286, "end": 3.483}, {"word": "it", "start": 3.483, "end": 3.68}, {"word": "every", "start": 3.921, "end": 4.42}, {"word": "time", "start": 4.42, "end": 4.752}, {"word": "it", "start": 4.752, "end": 4.919}, {"word": "changes", "start": 4.919, "end": 5.251}, {"word": "Every", "start": 5.501, "end": 5.949}, {"word": "case", "start": 5.949, "end": 6.247}, {"word": "comes", "start": 6.247, "end": 6.546}, {"word": "from", "start": 6.546, "end": 6.695}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.695, "end": 6.844}, {"word": "corpus", "start": 6.844, "end": 7.142}, {"word": "Golden", "start": 7.392, "end": 7.786}, {"word": "questions", "s